of modified sources:\n - org.apache.commons.compress.archivers.zip.ZipArchiveInputStream\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
  "bug_report_content": "Title: ZipArchiveInputStream.getNextZipEntry() should differentiate between \"invalid entry encountered\" and \"no more entries\"\nType: Bug | Priority: Minor | Status: Resolved | Resolution: Fixed\n\nDescription:\nZipArchiveInputStream.getNextZipEntry() currently returns null if an invalid entry is encountered.  Thus, it's not possible to differentiate between \"no more entries\" and \"invalid entry encountered\" conditions.\n\nInstead, it should throw an exception if an invalid entry is encountered.\n\nI've created a test case and fix. I will submit a pull request shortly.\n\nComments:\n\n[Michael Mole]: Attached is fix, new test, and fix for existing test.\n\n[Stefan Bodewig]: Patch applied, many thanks!",
  "fix_diff": ""
